  "body_excerpt_live_music_mention": "76px) 576px, 768px\" />\r\n\r\n                </a>\r\n            \r\n\r\n            <div class=\"homeFeatureDetailsWrapper\">\r\n                <h2>\r\n                    <a href=\"/our-spaces\">\r\n                        Our Spaces\r\n                    </a>\r\n                </h2>\r\n\r\n                <p>The Africa Centre is a home from home and offers welcoming and exciting spaces from our restaurant and bar to event spaces featuring live music , exhibitions and Africa Centre programme. You can also hire our spaces for your own event, be it a social occasion, team away day or community event.</p>\r\n\r\n                \r\n                    <footer class=\"featureFooter\">\r\n                        \r\n                            <p class=\"featurePublishWrapper\">\r\n                                <strong>Published:</strong>\r\n                                <time datetime=\"2021-03-18\">18<sup>th</sup> March, 2021</time>\r\n             "
